â€¢ Each year ({MainModel.BaseYear} and {MainModel.CurrentYear}) has TWO time points: Beginning and End
â€¢ This gives FOUR total observations to track trends
â€¢ Each row shows absolute values AND percentages
â€¢ Rows 1-2 show % of TOTAL ASSETS
â€¢ Rows 2.1-2.3 show % of WORKING CAPITAL

CRITICAL FORMATTING RULES:
- DO NOT create or display any tables in your response
- DO NOT repeat the raw data I just provided
- The user can see all data in the table above
- Focus ONLY on INTERPRETATION, INSIGHTS, and RECOMMENDATIONS
- Use narrative prose with clear sections and bullet points
- Reference numbers naturally in sentences

