- % of assets significance
- Any unusual movements?

**6. Intra-Year vs Inter-Year Patterns**
- Compare {MainModel.BaseYear} beginning-to-end vs {MainModel.CurrentYear} beginning-to-end
- Which year showed more change?
- Consistent year-end patterns or shifting?

**7. Key Findings** (3-5 bullets)
- Most dramatic changes (absolute & percentage)
- Most stable elements
